OL,3,GNEWSA'Antisocial behaviour is making my
OL,4,Atown feel unsafe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding outside her town centre cafe,
OL,7,FSharron Foley says anti-social
OL,8,Fbehaviour has become impossible to
OL,9,Fignore.
OL,11,FDrinkers openly carrying cans,
OL,12,Fsuspected drug use and street abuse
OL,13,Fhave become familiar sights, she said,
OL,14,Fleaving some customers reluctant to
OL,15,Fvisit her business in
OL,16,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, Staffordshire.
OL,18,F"It's not a good place at the minute,"
OL,19,FFoley said. "I don't feel the town is
OL,20,Fsafe any more."
